  "selfReview": "The coda as a sting. Critic round 1 (2026-11-24): it now starts with two video frames (66.7 ms) of digital silence before the downbeat; the sync point is in the metadata (`downbeatSec` 0.0667, `downbeatFrame30` 2), so a placement a frame early no longer clips the attack. The landing is carried by piano (4.7 dB under the mix), cymbal and snare; the kick sits 12.7 dB under (5.5 before). Badger is 0.3 dB under the motif on full range and 0.8 dB on the phone model (3.9 and 5.0 before).",
